<section id="ask">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ask">
      <div class="kicker">Finale · The Ask</div>
      <h2>Fund the bard, <em>fund the circle</em></h2>
      <p>A grant to Shaka doesn't fund a person. It funds a <strong>permissionless music space at the world's biggest Ethereum gathering</strong>, the broadcast windows that let the world watch popup villages build the future, the storytelling of a movement, and a walking embodiment of the ecosystem's values — decentralization, open source, radical inclusion — expressed in the universal language of music.</p>
      <p>He is already on the road: Burning Man, Tokyo, Mumbai, Chiang Mai. The question is only how much of the orchestra he can carry with him.</p>
